      "text": [
        "ه عن موسى بن عمر بن بزيع فقد رويته عن محمّد بن عليّ ماجيلويه- رحمه اللّه- عن علي بن إبراهيم، عن أبيه، عن موسى بن عمر بن بزيع‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Musa ibn Umar ibn Bazi has been transmitted by me from Muhammad ibn Ali Majilawayh - may Allah (swt) have mercy on him - from Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Musa ibn Umar ibn Bazi."
        ]
      }
